"ուղղորդելն է։</ahelp>"

#: 01100500.xhp#hd_id3153127.9.help.text
#: 01100500.xhp%23hd_id3153127.9.help.text
msgid "to URL"
msgstr "դեպի URL"

#: 01100500.xhp#par_id3153349.10.help.text
