"սեղմեք Spacebar-ը:"

#: 06040000.xhp#par_id3153394.help.text
#: 06040000.xhp%23par_id3153394.help.text
msgid ""
"To turn on or to turn off the AutoCorrect feature, in $[officename] Calc "
