#: 05360000.xhp#par_id3152771.27.help.text
#: 05360000.xhp%23par_id3152771.27.help.text
msgid ""
"<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_DISTRIBUTE:BTN_VER_BOTTOM\">"
